---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Back to the Woods | 2025 KTM 300 XC-W | Marc Sherwood';
const description = 'The latest addition to my garage: a 2025 KTM 300 XC-W, a return to technical BC singletrack and a new chapter in a lifelong motorcycle obsession.';
const priorities = [
  {title:'Get to know the bike.',body:'Ride it, learn the feel of its suspension and power delivery, and spend time on the terrain I care about before deciding what it needs.'},
  {title:'Protect the essentials.',body:'Review the skid plate, hand protection, cooling and the little things that matter when a ride takes you deep into the woods.'},
  {title:'Stay ahead of maintenance.',body:'Establish a service baseline and track hours, maintenance and the eventual top-end work. This is a bike I want to ride for years.'}
];
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} image={{src:"/assets/ktm300/purchase-day.jpg",width:1054,height:1400}} mainClass="flex-grow w-full">
  <section class="bg-slate-950 text-white border-b border-orange-600">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
      <div>
        <a href="/garage/" class="text-orange-300 font-semibold">Back to the Garage</a>
        <p class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-orange-400 mt-7 mb-4">New chapter · November 27, 2026</p>
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tighter leading-none mb-5">Back to<br/><span class="text-orange-400">the woods.</span></h1>
        <p class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">2025 KTM 300 XC-W</p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300 max-w-xl">A purpose-built enduro, a lifetime of two-strokes, and the chance to get back to the kind of riding I've been missing.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-orange-600 bg-slate-800"><img src="/assets/ktm300/purchase-day.jpg" alt="Marc with his new 2025 KTM 300 XC-W at Mountainview Motorsports" width="1054" height="1400" class="w-full h-auto object-contain" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-300">November 27, 2026 · It’s official.</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="bg-orange-50 border-y border-orange-100"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-5 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-slate-900">
    <div><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Model</p><strong class="text-xl">2025</strong></div><div><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Machine</p><strong class="text-xl">300 XC-W</strong></div><div><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Terrain</p><strong class="text-xl">BC woods</strong></div><div><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Status</p><strong class="text-xl">Purchased Nov. 27</strong></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-14 md:py-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-orange-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">01 / Why this bike?</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">The right tool for the trails I love.</h2>
    <div class="space-y-5 text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>My riding roots are motocross and two-strokes. The last bike I raced was a 1991 Kawasaki KX125, and the sound of a little two-stroke on the pipe has never left me. But these days it's the technical singletrack in the BC woods that keeps calling.</p>
      <p>I've spent a lot of time riding bikes built for other jobs, including the adventure bikes and my Suzuki RM250. This time, I chose a machine built for the job I actually want it to do.</p>
      <p>The 300 XC-W isn't about buying my way into being a better rider. It's about finding a bike that suits the terrain, developing my skills again, and spending less time wondering how to make the machine something it isn't.</p>
      <p>It's the same philosophy behind <a href="/thriftyjeep/" class="font-semibold text-orange-700 underline">Operation Thrifty Jeep</a>: learn the terrain, then make every change earn its place.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="bg-stone-100 border-y border-slate-200"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-14 md:py-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-orange-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">The new arrival</p><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">Meet the actual bike.</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 max-w-3xl mb-7">A first look at the 2025 300 XC-W, photographed at the dealership. Custom graphics, GUTS seat, swingarm guards and a Tusk rear brake pedal. The bike had approximately 125 engine hours at purchase.</p>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">{[['right-side.jpg','Right side'],['left-side.jpg','Left side'],['front-three-quarter.jpg','Front three-quarter'],['rear-three-quarter.jpg','Rear three-quarter']].map(([file,caption])=><a href={'/assets/ktm300/'+file} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 bg-white"><img src={'/assets/ktm300/'+file} alt={'2025 KTM 300 XC-W — '+caption} width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-auto"/><p class="p-3 font-semibold">{caption}</p></a>)}</div>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-5">Dealer gallery photo credit: <a href="https://www.mountainviewmotorsports.ca/USED-Inventory-2025-KTM-Motorcycle-Scooter-300-XC-W-Mountainview-Motorsports-19094794?ref=list" class="underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mountainview Motorsports, original dealer listing</a>. Trail photos to follow.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="bg-slate-900 text-white"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-14 md:py-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-orange-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">02 / The plan</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">Ride first. Modify with purpose.</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">{priorities.map(p=><article class="border border-slate-600 rounded-xl p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">{p.title}</h3><p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">{p.body}</p></article>)}</div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-14 md:py-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-orange-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">03 / Ride journal</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">Chapter one.</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">The KTM is the newest member of the herd. I'll add first impressions, trail stories and maintenance notes as this next chapter unfolds.</p>
    <article class="mt-8 border-l-4 border-orange-500 bg-stone-100 p-6 md:p-8">
      <p class="font-mono text-sm text-slate-500">November 27, 2026 · Mountainview Motorsports, Chilliwack</p>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl md:text-3xl mt-2 mb-5">One last ride. One new beginning.</h3>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p>The ride out to Chilliwack on the KTM 790 Adventure S was pretty nice, if a touch cold. It rode so well that I actually felt bad trading it in. A fitting send-off for a bike I've really enjoyed. Then I took one look at the 300 XC-W, and that was it.</p>
        <p>Dad texted me that morning to offer a ride if I needed one. He met me out at the dealership. What a win.</p>
        <p>The folks at Mountainview Motorsports found a small radiator leak during their inspection that morning and are ordering a replacement radiator. I appreciate that they caught it and are taking care of it. I also discovered another little upgrade on the bike: a Tusk rear brake pedal.</p>
        <p>While I was there, I took a Ducati Scrambler 1100 out for a spin. What a hoot to ride! For now, though, the new chapter is all about getting back into the woods on the 300.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-8">{[['dealer-arrival.jpg','First look outside the dealership'],['front-detail.jpg','A closer look at the new KTM']].map(([file,caption])=><a href={'/assets/ktm300/'+file} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-white border border-slate-200"><img src={'/assets/ktm300/'+file} alt={caption} width="1054" height="1400" class="w-full h-auto" loading="lazy"/><p class="p-3 text-sm font-semibold">{caption}</p></a>)}</div>
      <div class="mt-7 rounded-xl border border-orange-200 bg-orange-50 p-5"><p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-orange-700 mb-2">Maintenance log · Open item</p><h4 class="font-bold text-lg">Radiator replacement</h4><p class="text-slate-700 mt-1">Small leak identified during the dealer inspection. The dealership is ordering a replacement radiator; installation pending.</p></div>
    </article>
    <div class="mt-8 border-l-4 border-orange-500 bg-stone-100 p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-slate-500">November 2026</p><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mt-1">The decision is made.</h3><p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">After looking at the available options, the 2025 300 XC-W is the bike I chose for the return to the woods.</p></div>
    <a href="/garage/" class="mt-8 inline-block font-semibold text-orange-700">Explore the rest of the Garage</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
